---
import { STORY_APP_URL, STORY_NAME } from '@/lib/app'
---

<div id="faq-modal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-70">
  <div id="faq-backdrop" class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/80"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-y-auto">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-6 relative">
      <button
        id="faq-close"
        class="sticky top-4 float-right text-mist text-3xl font-kyivtype cursor-pointer bg-transparent border-none z-10"
      >
        ✕
      </button>
      <h1 class="text-4xl leading-tight text-mist font-kyivtype mb-4">More Info</h1>

      <div class="bg-black/85 rounded-lg p-5 mb-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl leading-tight text-mist font-kyivtype mb-3">What You Need to Know</h2>
        <ul class="text-lg text-mist font-youngest list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>A 45–75 minute walking story you play on the Story City app.</li>
          <li>
            <strong>Track breaches across your city</strong> - uncover Wonderland characters and unstable pockets
            of reality throughout the city.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Bring a charged phone</strong> - to follow Alice’s clues, unlock encounters, and capture surreal photo
            moments.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Your choices, your ending</strong> - every decision shapes your path and the fate of your city.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Your team can be any size</strong> - perfect for curious minds, couples, families, or competitive crews.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-black/85 rounded-lg p-5 mb-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl leading-tight text-mist font-kyivtype mb-3">Story Details</h2>
        <img
          src="/CYE_v2.webp"
          alt="Choose Your Ending experience flowchart"
          class="w-full h-auto rounded mb-4"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <p class="text-lg text-mist font-youngest mb-3">
          Wonderland is leaking into your streets. The park becomes a croquet court. The café hosts a never-ending tea
          party. Alice is guiding you from the other side. One start. Multiple paths. Three endings.
        </p>

        <p class="text-lg text-mist font-youngest mb-3">
          Will your team seal the breaches, or let the Queen claim your city?
        </p>
        <ol class="text-lg text-mist font-youngest list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>
            <strong>Get the app</strong> - open{' '}
            <a href={STORY_APP_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline">
              {STORY_NAME}
            </a>{' '}
            on the Story City app. Play solo or as a team.
          </li>
          <li><strong>Head to the start</strong> - the app shows where your route begins and guides you there.</li>
          <li>
            <strong>Play the adventure</strong> - the app guides you from location to location as Wonderland seeps into
            reality, tracking your progress and choices.
          </li>
          <li><strong>Take your time</strong> - most teams finish in 45–75 minutes</li>
          <li>
            <strong>Make your choices</strong> - follow the Rabbit, resist the Queen, or take advantage of the chaos to unlock
            3 possible endings
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-black/85 rounded-lg p-5 mb-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl leading-tight text-mist font-kyivtype mb-3">How Intense is it & Other FAQs</h2>
        <ul class="text-lg text-mist font-youngest list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>
            <strong>“Is it intense?”</strong> It’s whimsical with a twist. Expect playful chaos, curious encounters, and a
            city that’s slightly… off. Puzzles offer hard or easy versions.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>“Do I dress up?”</strong> Absolutely - Go mad! Tea party chic, Wonderland royalty, or curious adventurer.
          </li>
          <li><strong>“Can I bring pets?”</strong> Yes! Your furry sidekick is welcome.</li>
          <li>
            <strong>“Are there age restrictions?”</strong> Children and strollers are welcome, content rating is PG, we recommend
            8+ mostly due to experience length and walking distance for children.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-black/85 rounded-lg p-5 mb-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl leading-tight text-mist font-kyivtype mb-3">About Story City</h2>
        <div class="text-lg text-mist font-youngest space-y-3">
          <p>
            Story City is a small, independent, 10-person creative-tech studio on a mission: To empower people to share
            and step into the world's stories.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our no-code platform has helped 200+ creators turn real streets into playable storyworlds - stories you can
            step inside, explore, and change through your choices.
          </p>
          <p>
            We have partnered with festivals, museums, cities (eg. City of Atlanta, Calgary, Melbourne UNESCO City),
            non-profits (eg. Human Rights Foundation), and creators around the world.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-black/85 rounded-lg p-5 mb-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl leading-tight text-mist font-kyivtype mb-3">Before You Go</h2>
        <ul class="text-lg text-mist font-youngest list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>👟 Walking: ~1-1.5 miles</li>
          <li>Install the Story City app before you head out</li>
          <li>Headphones or Bluetooth speaker are recommended for immersive audio moments</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-black/85 rounded-lg p-5 mb-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl leading-tight text-mist font-kyivtype mb-3">Safety</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-mist font-youngest mb-3">Our adventures are:</p>
        <ul class="text-lg text-mist font-youngest list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Outdoors and naturally socially distanced (if you need!)</li>
          <li>Flexible - pause anytime, continue at your pace</li>
          <li>Designed to be stroller and wheelchair friendly where possible</li>
          <li>
            Your location is only tracked while using the app to unlock experience content tied to specific locations.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  const modal = document.getElementById('faq-modal')!
  const backdrop = document.getElementById('faq-backdrop')!
  const closeBtn = document.getElementById('faq-close')!

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-faq-trigger]').forEach(el => {
    el.addEventListener('click', e => {
      e.preventDefault()
      modal.classList.remove('hidden')
      document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden'
    })
  })

  function close() {
    modal.classList.add('hidden')
    document.body.style.overflow = ''
  }

  closeBtn.addEventListener('click', close)
  backdrop.addEventListener('click', close)
</script>
